Working groups started to get created last year as a way to
ensure some important aspects of the project are being well
looked after.  As it now seems like a good solution and we're
expecting probably a few more to appear in the coming months, a
new section is being added to the documentation.  It is currently
visible only on the staging website:

  https://static.staging.kernelci.org/docs/org/working-groups/

The corresponding pull request with the changes is here:

  https://github.com/kernelci/kernelci-project/pull/108


Please feel free to add comments on GitHub or reply on this email
thread if you would like to suggest changes to the documentation
or if you have any questions.

Best wishes,
